{"type":"json_object","message":"I interpret the question as asking for the total increase in unrecognized tax benefits over the two-year period covering fiscal 2007 and 2008. The reconciliation table shows the balance at the beginning of 2007 was $70.5 million (source:t1c2n0) and the balance at the end of 2008 was $214.4 million (source:t8c1n0). The increase is the ending 2008 balance minus the beginning 2007 balance, both in millions of dollars.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"end_2008 - begin_2007","variables":{"end_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"millions USD"},"begin_2007":{"value":70.5,"source":"source:t1c2n0","unit":"millions USD"}},"sources":{"end_2008":"source:t8c1n0","begin_2007":"source:t1c2n0"}}}